      "reason": "Sahi sent no open interest for this instrument (open_interest, a proto3 optional, is off its ticks); the web publishes oi 0 for it (sahi_mapping.py build_quote_payload), a number the exchange never sent. The desktop leaves it out (docs: a field the stream does not carry is left out; decisions.md).",
